%% Shadow Portfolio flow — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart LR
  Decision[Decision-time proposal / rejection] --> Inclusion[Registered inclusion policy]
  Inclusion -->|Insufficient rules or data| Unevaluable[Unevaluable with reason]
  Inclusion --> Frozen[Freeze entry / exit / costs / capital]
  Frozen --> Allocation[Counterfactual capital-constrained allocation]
  Allocation --> Sim[Isolated simulator]
  Sim --> Ledger[Shadow namespace Ledger]
  Ledger --> Compare[Comparable metrics + limitations]
  Actual[Active-paper evaluation snapshots] --> Compare
  Compare --> League[Offline Research League]
  League --> Knowledge[Empirical Knowledge / owner review only]
  Diagnostic[Independent opportunity diagnostics] --> Compare
